{"id": "224501", "name": "נכון/לא נכון: תכונה של Y = X² עבור X נורמלי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma)\\)</span> לאיזשהו פרמטר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sigma&gt;0\\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=X^2\\)</span>. אזי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">[[if test=\"{{CT:1}}\"]]הטענה נכונה[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]הטענה לא נכונה[[/if]]</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:1}}\"]]לפי הסימטריה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma)\\)</span> סביב 0 (ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}|X|^3\\lt\\infty\\)</span>), המומנטים האי-זוגיים מתאפסים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[X^3]=0\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Cov}(X,Y)=\\mathbb{E}[X\\cdot X^2]-\\mathbb{E}[X]\\,\\mathbb{E}[X^2]=\\mathbb{E}[X^3]-0=0 \\]</p>[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> נקבע לגמרי על ידי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span>. למשל, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|X|\\leq 1\\)</span> גורר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\leq 1\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}\\left[|X|\\leq 1,\\ Y> 1\\right]=0 \\]</p>ואילו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\left[|X|\\leq 1\\right]> 0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[Y> 1]> 0\\)</span> (לכל קטע יש הסתברות חיובית תחת התפלגות נורמלית). לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> תלויים (אף שהם בלתי מתואמים, כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X^3]=0\\)</span>):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}\\left[|X|\\leq 1,\\ Y> 1\\right]\\neq\\mathbb{P}\\left[|X|\\leq 1\\right]\\cdot\\mathbb{P}[Y> 1] \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["q", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 2}